From 825c5c684faf9518a0add792322f66c47b7f17a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: charles <dminus@andestech.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Dec 2023 05:11:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 028/168] riscv: andes: dts: add cache-line-size to device tree
 node l2c

During cache initialization, the cache-line-size from the l2c
device tree node will be read.

In the dma-noncoherent configuration, this will be used for cache operations.

Signed-off-by: charles <dminus@andestech.com>
---
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/andes/a25mp_c4_d_dsp_ae350.dts              | 1 +
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/andes/a27l2_c1_d_dsp_noncoherent_ae350.dts  | 1 +
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/andes/a45mp_c4_d_dsp_ae350.dts              | 1 +
